Stack Decision:

For a capstone project, I recommend Java + Spring Boot + MySQL + React rather than only Core Java.

Recommended Stack:

| **Layer / Tool**    | **Technology**                | **Purpose in Hospital Bed Availability System** | **What It Handles**                              |
| ------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| **Frontend**        | HTML, CSS, JavaScript / React | Creates the user interface                      | Dashboard, bed status, forms, tables             |
| **Backend**         | Java                          | Implements application logic                    | Bed allocation, patient management, availability |
| **Framework**       | Spring Boot                   | Simplifies Java backend development             | REST APIs, services, controllers                 |
| **Database**        | MySQL                         | Stores project data                             | Patients, beds, wards, users, allocations        |
| **API**             | REST API                      | Connects frontend and backend                   | Sending and receiving data                       |
| **IDE**             | VS Code                       | Used for writing and managing code              | Coding, debugging, terminal                      |
| **Version Control** | Git                           | Tracks code changes                             | Commit, branch, version history                  |
| **Repository**      | GitHub                        | Stores project online                           | Source code, documentation, collaboration        |
| **Testing**         | Postman                       | Tests REST APIs                                 | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE requests                  |
| **Build Tool**      | Maven                         | Manages Java project dependencies and builds    | Libraries, compilation, packaging                |

