Why this stack?

Java:

   Object-oriented
   Good for large applications
   Strongly used in enterprise applications

Spring Boot

   Simplifies Java backend development
   Supports REST APIs
   Provides good project structure

MySQL

    Suitable for structured hospital data
    Supports relationships between patients, beds, wards, and allocations

React

    Can provide an interactive dashboard
    Useful for displaying real-time-style bed status

GitHub

    Stores project source code
    Tracks project versions
    Useful for demonstrating your capstone work



